        slash_pos = s.find('/')
        # Scheme exists if colon is found and either no slash or colon comes before slash
        # But careful: file:///path has colon at position 4, slash at 5,6,7
        # Also, a path like /path:to/file should not be treated as scheme
        # Scheme must be at the start and consist of valid scheme characters
